</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The DER data to encode. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>der_len</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The length of the DER data <computeroutput>der_data</computeroutput> in Bytes. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
